x-data\">7.004시간</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>(10199) 커리클로</b>는 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%84%BC%ED%83%80%EC%9A%B0%EB%A3%A8%EC%8A%A4%EA%B5%B0\" title=\"센타우루스군\">센타우루스군</a>의 <a href=\"/wiki/%EC%86%8C%ED%96%89%EC%84%B1%EC%B2%B4\" title=\"소행성체\">소행성체</a>이다.\n2014년 <a href=\"/wiki/%EA%B3%A0%EB%A6%AC\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"고리\">고리</a>가 발견되었다.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"같이_보기\"><span id=\".EA.B0.99.EC.9D.B4_.EB.B3.B4.EA.B8.B0\"></span>같이 보기</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=10199_%EC%BB%A4%EB%A6%AC%ED%81%B4%EB%A1%9C&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"문단 편집: 같이 보기\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=10199_%EC%BB%A4%EB%A6%AC%ED%81%B4%EB%A1%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"문단의 원본 코드 편집: 같이 보기\"><span>원본 편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/2060_%ED%82%A4%EB%A1%A0\" title=\"2060 키론\">2060 키론</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"외부_링크\"><span id=\".EC.99.B8.EB.B6.80_.EB.A7.81.ED.81.AC\"></span>외부 링크</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=10199_%EC%BB%A4%EB%A6%AC%ED%81%B4%EB%A1%9C&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"문단 편집: 외부 링크\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=10199_%EC%BB%A4%EB%A6%AC%ED%81%B4%EB%A1%9C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"문단의 원본 코드 편집: 외부 링크\"><span>원본 편집</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/20px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"asyn